			"Message": "docs(Output): Rewrite README with concise structure and inline SVG footer\n\nStrip decorative HTML tables, excess emoji formatting, and verbose component breakdowns from the README. Consolidate sections into a clearer hierarchy — Overview, Architecture (Mermaid diagram), Key Components (markdown table), In the Land Project (contextual description), Getting Started, API Reference, and Funding/acknowledgements.\n\nReplace the multi-image HTML table footer with compact inline SVG logo links for Land, PlayForm, NLnet, and NGI0. Update LICENSE link to /blob/ path for direct file access. Remove redundant \"Deep Dive,\" \"See Also,\" and \"Changelog\" sections that duplicated information now captured in the simplified structure.\n\nThe result is a leaner, more maintainable document that reads cleanly both on GitHub and npm.",
